# Blog v2 is SoT

- Skill: `authoring-blog-posts-v2` if present; else `.cursor/skills/ws-blog-v2-contract`. Leave v1 `authoring-blog-posts` untouched.
- Airtable **WS Blog** `appQA9UR7KiKscbG5`. Live Posts table: **`tblfOqqLYXLjFtBl0`**. Older schema docs that point Posts at `tbl3ONBuy5H3kIbqv` are wrong — that ID is Authors.
- If it is not in Airtable, it is not the plan. `node scripts/blog-sync.mjs pull` before planning. `push --slug=<slug>` after the artifact is ready.
- Artifact path: `content/blog/YYYY/MM/<slug>.md`. camelCase frontmatter only. Default `serviceTrack: "ai-visibility"`.
- Cover: `/images/blog/<slug>.png` (not `{slug}-cover.png`).
- Gate: `npm run validate-blog` and `node scripts/audit-blog-links.mjs` before calling a post ready.
